;
; Filename: MPGmacro4.mac
; Description: ATC Reset -- wireless MPG Aux Key 4
; Requires: CNC12; tools 199 and 200 assigned the same bin in the Tool Library
;
; CNC12 runs this for wireless MPG macro button 4. The code MUST sit between N100 and
; N1000, and the stock M225 example message must be gone. The reset action lives in
; mfunc20.mac (M20), shared with the VCP ATC RESET button.
;
IF #50001                        ; Prevent lookahead from parsing past here
IF #4201 || #4202 THEN GOTO 1000 ; Skip macro if graphing or searching
N100                             ; ---- code must live between N100 and N1000 ----
M20                              ; ATC Reset
N1000                            ; End of Macro
